    "created_at": "2016-04-25T22:23:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T22:23:23Z",
    "body": "Another wrinkle to consider: the behavior of media with multiple video or audio and corrupt or inaccessible non-main tracks. Falling back to the main track seems like reasonable behavior but it would definitely be helpful to indicate the error to application code so the change can be reflected to users.\n",
